"A list names sites to block, and covers every name under each: listing example.com blocks ads.example.com. NetworkMonitor downloads each list you switch on from its makers, weekly, never on a hotspot or a metered connection, and keeps the last good copy. It reads hosts files, plain lists of names, and Adblock rules about whole sites (||example.com^, with @@ exceptions). Rules about parts of pages are for the Chrome extension. Each list you add blocks more, and makes it likelier that one blocks something a site needs to work. If a site stops working, today's counts show which list blocked what." = "列表列出要拦截的网站，并涵盖每个网站下的所有名称：列出 example.com 就会拦截 ads.example.com。NetworkMonitor 每周从制作者那里下载你打开的每个列表，在热点或按流量计费的连接上从不下载，并保留最后一份完好的副本。它能读取 hosts 文件、纯名称列表，以及针对整个网站的 Adblock 规则（||example.com^，可用 @@ 设例外）。针对网页部分内容的规则由 Chrome 扩展处理。你每添加一个列表，拦截的内容就更多，某个列表拦截网站正常运行所需内容的可能性也越大。如果某个网站无法正常使用，可通过今天的计数查看哪个列表拦截了什么。";
